  "findings": [
    "Python2 except syntax prevents Python3 parsing; wx widgets not imported or tested.",
    "ReorderByColumn computes single_column from SetNewOrder then ignores it and calls reorder(single_column=True). Compound-column selection therefore sorts only by first requested key. Static finding.",
    "SetNewOrder simple-column path indexes sortOrder[0] without handling empty initial order; empty sort defaults can fail. Compound path zip truncation can also treat an empty/incomplete order as unchanged. Static finding.",
    "Reorder changes visible row positions without remapping indicated index or selected rows; source TODO explicitly calls out selection preservation. No GUI behavior validation.",
    "Displayed percentages use a caller-supplied total; unsupported/zero totals retain raw value. A percentage table is not proof of additive CPU timing or complete profiling coverage.",
